<title>USA: Amcore in pact to buy Country Bank Shares.</title>
<headline>Amcore in pact to buy Country Bank Shares.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amcore Financial Inc said Thursday it has entered a letter of intent to acquire Country Bank Shares Corp, a Mount Horeb, Wisconsin-based bank holding company with $285 million in assets.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, Amcore will exchange 4.3267 shares of its stock for each share of outstanding stock in Country Bank Shares. Country Bank Shares currently has approximately 440,000 shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
